  description: '3 Level 10 monsters that cannot be Normal Summoned/Set

    Must
    be either Fusion Summoned, or Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by sending
    the above cards you control to the GY. You can only Special Summon "The Chaotic
    Phantasmal Sacred Beasts" once per turn this way, no matter which method you
    use. The first two times this card on the field would be destroyed by card effect
    each turn, it is not destroyed. Once per Chain, up to thrice per turn (Quick
    Effect): You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; negate its
    effects (until the end of this turn), then you can gain LP equal to half that
    monster''s ATK.'
